    - target: {fileID: 8042695241032929803, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: Matter is anything that has mass and takes up space. The amount of space
        it takes up is called its volume. T
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8213679805980576235, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "There are seven items on the workbenches. Let\u2019s examine each one
        and discover which are matter. Walk up to a bench to take a closer look.
        T"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8309883683856338107, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: On this table is a balled up piece of paper. Let's click it and learn
        its properties. Click the cross to leave the table. T
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8326609813092478031, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: On this table is a patch of light from a lamp beside a carrot. Click
        the carrot or the patch of light to explore its properties. Click the cross
        to leave the table. T
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8339649756217162524, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "On this table is a balloon filled with air. Beside it, you\u2019ll
        see a shadow cast by a cube. Click the balloon or the shadow to explore its
        properties. Click the cross to leave the table. r"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
